{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_026_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eea7b5aeb49ba8e179ac8148af5ccec359ac13c7404596d3aaaa7199472accd1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca30b880d65883a4a323fa279362cc11de36cff867f59351b39a39a397b69c8",
      "text": "哦，●●●●●●●●●●番长，\n你回来了啊。能借用你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1631d08c1358fdf6586caa7953a8deda3603b86a3d7ec9e544165904e53c28f9",
      "text": "我带了情人节的谢礼过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03c41347f7921475889048314d5b810b5813ea12f7464fe773e451131e2f0ce1",
      "text": "虽然我觉得自己根本不是过白色情人节的料，\n但这是要送给番长的东西。可顾不上说那些话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c9a84fb21c0679148868d72728abed6f6882e355c1e710aee1d97a560f18a54",
      "text": "我挑选了自认为最无可挑剔的一件，\n并倾注了我自己的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45694db9ebf97f92c1a4ea46a9b7a76f099522adcbbfc534666cdb6b4260af84",
      "text": "你要是能喜欢的话，俺就高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d0fa8486d57a75a4d517291a34ef9e15b64361b482a3c1abbfa452e3d95d85",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:700708e92a09001d82a7cac42c70291de8135ec0a1e35fa71c9f3d31442ca9d8",
      "text": "想着差不多该到休息时间了吧，\n看来我猜得挺准嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fa4d11592cfc65f1ab86f605f4de00e33559512e947bfd2709e50545565146a",
      "text": "情人节的时候，谢谢你的巧克力啦。\n我可是好好珍惜着吃完了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c55185237a24a20dd0a319b64688dc81b36100646179d7e89edbc34d8a896e38",
      "text": "巧克力中倾注的炽热心意，\n确实地传达到了我的胸膛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b8a5ecad58853ee7754077afa34ae969e23799e03cbefdd217be86fd8750c39",
      "text": "承蒙恩义自当奉还。\n这是白色情人节的礼物，收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15426ddd561e48aaf8f1fc37f36387b9ac57a93acf7cac0b6f2c7548c9eb2c0b",
      "text": "回礼中倾注的炽热心意，我切实收到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:848eabc0ec73c319535886458fd1c880edc300f202b0d3d062fb0e587529fb66",
      "text": "挑选礼物还真是一件难事啊。\n但话虽如此，我可没有半点妥协。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:848eabc0ec73c319535886458fd1c880edc300f202b0d3d062fb0e587529fb66",
      "text": "挑选礼物还真是一件难事啊。\n但话虽如此，我可没有半点妥协。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40cdbc1834473d35e00953fff698583841d684744d3fe66421c4920989007236",
      "text": "要是能合番长的心意就好了呢。\n有空的时候看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_026_22:5_02_026_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18623217a51b3562bde0cc17591c03ec175f4870fc5cb2822c118b0e468e1fb",
      "text": "那么，我就不打扰了。好好休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
